L1185@P17: 77 ### 7. Conclusions & Recommendations
L1186@P17: 78 1. **Predictive Power:** The curated 47-feature set achieves **96.85 %
L1187@P17: ,→ accuracy**, comparable to the original set.
L1188@P17: 79 2. **Feature Importance:** Interaction terms (especially those coupling
L1189@P17: ,→ elevation/soil/wilderness with distance/hydrology) are the key drivers.
